--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The APU channel timing and quirks, the mode 3 pixel pipeline, the OAM
corruption bug, the OAM DMA bus conflicts and their effect on the PPU, the CGB
speed switch timing, the PPU register write timing, the serial clock, the
