Other dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Rust crates that Nubo is built from are distributed under their own
licenses (mostly MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC and Zlib). THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt,
which comes with the macOS app, the web version and the RetroArch core, lists
every crate with its license and contains their license texts. `cargo xtask licenses <folder>`
writes it for the desktop app.
